IMPORT prelude

§ `Jurisdiction Library`

-- Library for representing jurisdictions (countries, regions, states, municipalities)
-- Uses ISO 3166-1 codes (alpha-2 and alpha-3) for countries
-- Uses ISO 3166-2 codes for subdivisions
-- Version 1.0.0 (2024-12-16)

§§ `Version`

@nlg the version of the Jurisdiction Library
`Jurisdiction Library Version` MEANS "1.0.0"
@nlg the version date of the Jurisdiction Library
`Jurisdiction Library Date` MEANS "2024-12-16"


§§ `Country Codes - ISO 3166-1`

-- Major countries with both alpha-2 and alpha-3 codes
-- Format: Country name, 2-letter code, 3-letter code, numeric code

@nlg the ISO 3166 alpha-2 code for the United States
`United States alpha-2` MEANS "US"
@nlg the ISO 3166 alpha-3 code for the United States
`United States alpha-3` MEANS "USA"
@nlg the ISO 3166 numeric code for the United States
`United States numeric` MEANS 840

